     argument _p_s_h_a_r_e_d may have one of the following values:

     PTHREAD_PROCESS_PRIVATE  The barrier object it is attached to may only be
                              accessed by threads in the same process as the
                              one that created the object.

     PTHREAD_PROCESS_SHARED   The barrier object it is attached to may be ac‐
                              cessed by threads in processes other than the
                              one that created the object.

